      <title>尽管战争中断，沙特阿美公司利润仍大幅增长 33%</title>
      <link>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/08/04/business/saudi-aramco-earnings-iran-war.html</link>
      <description><![CDATA[油价上涨推动沙特阿拉伯能源巨头季度盈利大幅增长，该公司利用管道来解决霍尔木兹海峡的中断问题。]]></description>
      <guid>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/08/04/business/saudi-aramco-earnings-iran-war.html</guid>
      <pubDate>Tue, 04 Aug 2026 07:31:44 GMT</pubDate>
