    <item>
      <title>在霍尔木兹海峡工作的水手陷入伊朗战争的交火中</title>
      <link>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/08/04/business/iran-strait-hormuz-shipping-sailors.html</link>
      <description><![CDATA[数千名平民工人仍被困在面临伊朗袭击风险的船上。其中一艘船上的水手已被伊朗海军扣押了三个多月。]]></description>
      <guid>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/08/04/business/iran-strait-hormuz-shipping-sailors.html</guid>
      <pubDate>Tue, 04 Aug 2026 04:01:09 GMT</pubDate>
    </item>
