    <item>
      <title>伊朗和阿曼之间即将达成的重新开放霍尔木兹的协议将使特朗普付出代价</title>
      <link>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/08/03/us/politics/strait-of-hormuz-possible-reopening-deal.html</link>
      <description><![CDATA[该协议将允许船只再次航行，解决特朗普总统最紧迫的政治问题。但这将赋予伊朗战前不具备的战略影响力。]]></description>
      <guid>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/08/03/us/politics/strait-of-hormuz-possible-reopening-deal.html</guid>
      <pubDate>Tue, 04 Aug 2026 01:19:28 GMT</pubDate>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>皮罗在白宫会见特朗普，此前特朗普说她在反映泳池案件中“窒息”</title>
      <link>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/08/03/us/politics/trump-pirro-reflecting-pool-vandalism.html</link>
      <description><![CDATA[特朗普总统表示，华盛顿特区联邦检察官珍妮·皮罗“像雨伞一样折叠起来”。据两位知情人士透露，目前，她的工作似乎很安全。]]></description>
      <guid>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/08/03/us/politics/trump-pirro-reflecting-pool-vandalism.html</guid>
      <pubDate>Tue, 04 Aug 2026 00:23:06 GMT</pubDate>
    </item>
